    "text": "LIVE | US Senate Races Toward Final Vote on $70B Border Security Plan | APT ClipsA high-stakes showdown unfolds in the US Senate as lawmakers power through a marathon “vote-a-rama” session to advance a $70 billion funding plan for Immigration and Customs Enforcement and Border Patrol. With dozens of amendments debated overnight, both Republicans and Democrats clash over border security priorities, spending levels, and immigration policy direction. The intense voting session sets the stage for a final decision that could shape US border enforcement for the next three years, making it one of the most closely watched legislative battles on Capitol Hill. #US #senate #ICE Join this channel to get access to perks: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpLEtz3H0jSfEneSdf1YKnw/join",
